# Every text file here keeps LF line endings on every system, so file digests, packed pages and HyperSVGs
# are the same everywhere (Git for Windows converts text to CRLF otherwise).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.tgz binary
*.zip binary
